#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:10
msgid "Timers, PWM, capture and encoders"
msgstr "定时器、PWM、捕获与编码器"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:12
msgid ""
"These interfaces describe timed outputs, captured observations and encoder "
"counts. The selected provider defines controller/channel combinations, clock"
" and synchronization limits; a public declaration does not authorize every "
"timer mode."
msgstr "这些接口描述定时输出、捕获观测及编码器计数。所选 provider 定义控制器／通道组合、时钟和同步限制；公共声明不授予全部定时器模式。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:17
msgid "Public declarations"
msgstr "公共声明"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:19
msgid "advanced_pwm.h"
msgstr "advanced_pwm.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "Optional fixed complementary PWM with latched break."
msgstr "可选固定互补 PWM 与锁存刹车。"

