msgid "Functions"
msgstr "函数"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "Stage duty against the fixed declared PSC/ARR and complementary pair."
msgstr "依据固定声明的 PSC/ARR 与互补通道对暂存占空比。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid ""
"Shadow duty becomes effective at the next update. Hardware deadtime encoding"
" must exactly represent the cold-configured tDTS count; PSC does not scale "
"deadtime. This API does not certify pin timing."
msgstr ""
"影子 duty 在下一次 update 时生效。硬件死区编码必须精确表示冷配置的 tDTS 计数；PSC 不会缩放死区。此 API 不认证引脚时序。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "[in] One serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 一个串行化的特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "[in] Zero through the maintained period, inclusive."
msgstr "[in] 从零到维护中的周期值，含两端。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT; no base-clock reconfiguration."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT；不重新配置基础时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "Enable outputs only with inactive break and no latched fault."
msgstr "仅刹车未激活且无锁存故障时启用输出。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid ""
"Automatic output reenabling and irreversible hardware LOCK are prohibited. A"
" break never silently starts outputs again."
msgstr "禁止自动重新使能输出及不可逆的硬件 LOCK。break 绝不会静默重新启动输出。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner of reviewed pin/clock/vector leases."
msgstr "[in] 已审查引脚、时钟及向量租约的特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT; failure retains ownership."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT；失败时保留所有权。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "Disable/read back master output and both channel sources."
msgstr "禁用并读回主输出与两个通道源。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid ""
"Cold assembly keeps the reviewed inactive-pin and shared-vector leases until"
" success and IRQ quiescence. A latched break survives stop."
msgstr "冷装配保留已审查的非活动引脚及共享向量租约，直到成功且 IRQ 静止。已锁存的 break 在停止后仍保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner, no concurrent duty/lifecycle calls."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者；不得并发调用 duty 或生命周期操作。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "SUCCESS proves output source detachment; BUSY retains responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明输出源已分离；BUSY 保留责任。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "Query staged duty, actual enable state and latched break facts."
msgstr "查询暂存占空比、实际启用状态与锁存刹车事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "[out] Separate writable snapshot, never provider storage."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写的快照，绝不能是 provider 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "Clear a software fault only while disabled and BKIN is inactive."
msgstr "仅已禁用且 BKIN 未激活时清除软件故障。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid ""
"Physical input and pending hardware break are rechecked. Application "
"recovery policy and external power safety remain outside Nexus."
msgstr "重新检查物理输入及待处理的硬件 break。应用恢复策略和外部电源安全由 Nexus 之外负责。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "[in] Privileged task recovery owner."
msgstr "[in] 执行恢复的特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT; does not enable outputs."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 BUSY/STATE/IO/CONTEXT；不会使能输出。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "Counts use the fixed post-prescaler clock; deadtime uses tDTS."
msgstr "计数使用固定预分频后的时钟；死区使用 tDTS。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "Shared immutable controls; configuration is a cold assembly fact."
msgstr "共享不可变控制；配置是冷装配事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:21
msgid "Immutable identity; controller state and configuration outlive IRQs."
msgstr "不可变身份；控制器状态与配置必须在所有 IRQ 完全退出前保持有效。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:25
msgid "encoder.h"
msgstr "encoder.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Optional raw modulo quadrature encoder observations."
msgstr "可选的原始模数正交编码器观察。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Enums"
msgstr "枚举"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Logical A/B phase counting, never a freely combinable mask."
msgstr "逻辑 A／B 相位计数，不是可任意组合的 mask。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid ""
"A and B follow the statically bound input order. x2 counts both edges of the"
" selected phase; x4 counts both edges of both phases."
msgstr "A 与 B 按静态绑定的输入顺序排列。x2 计数所选相位的两个边沿；x4 计数两个相位的全部边沿。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Enable only the two cold-selected encoder inputs and counter."
msgstr "仅启用冷装配选定的两个编码器输入与计数器。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid ""
"The provider never changes pins, rate, filtering or mode at runtime. Clock, "
"pin and vector leases belong to cold assembly through close."
msgstr "provider 绝不在运行时改变引脚、速率、滤波或模式。时钟、引脚及向量租约从冷装配一直保持到关闭。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "[in] One serialized privileged Thread-mode owner."
msgstr "[in] 一个串行化的特权 Thread-mode 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "SUCCESS or error; a failed write keeps recovery responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或错误；写入失败保留恢复责任。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Observe counter and input-source withdrawal before returning."
msgstr "观察计数器与输入源均已撤离后才返回。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Stop preserves the raw position. It does not release cold resources."
msgstr "停止保留原始位置，不释放冷资源。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "[in] The same serialized privileged Thread-mode owner."
msgstr "[in] 同一个串行化的特权 Thread-mode 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "SUCCESS proves source withdrawal; failure retains the session."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明源已撤回；失败保留会话。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Read one modulo position without inferring travel across wraps."
msgstr "读取一个模数位置，不推断跨回绕的行程。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid ""
"observed_at is software observation time, not a sensor edge aperture. "
"Direction, speed, mechanical zero and unbounded signed position need "
"external sampling bounds and product policy. A read cannot reconstruct "
"missed full wraps. No separately read DIR bit is an atomic edge history."
msgstr ""
"observed_at "
"是软件观察时间，不是传感器边沿采样孔径。方向、速度、机械零位及无界有符号位置，需要外部采样约束和产品策略。一次读取无法重建漏掉的完整回绕。单独读取的 "
"DIR 位不是原子边沿历史。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged Thread-mode owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化的特权 Thread-mode 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "[out] Aligned separate output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐的独立输出；拒绝时不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Report counter width and semantic input qualification facts."
msgstr "报告计数器位宽与具有明确语义的输入滤波条件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid ""
"Declared sampling and their kernel clock do not qualify noise rejection, "
"physical edge rate or electrical sensor/Board behavior."
msgstr "声明的采样条件与滤波基准时钟不建立抗噪、物理边沿速率或传感器／Board 电气行为资格。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "One raw modulo counter and separate software observation time."
msgstr "一个原始模数计数值与独立的软件观察时间。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Input qualification in the reported filter clock domain."
msgstr "在所报告滤波时钟域中的输入滤波条件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid ""
"A zero divisor and sample count mean bypass. Otherwise the filter samples at"
" filter_clock_hz / clock_divisor and requires the declared consecutive equal"
" samples. This describes the selected digital filter, not an exact debounce "
"time, physical edge bandwidth or sensor quality."
msgstr ""
"divisor 与 sample count 均为零表示 bypass。其他情况下，滤波器按 filter_clock_hz / "
"clock_divisor 采样，并要求声明数量的连续同值样本。这描述所选数字滤波器，不代表精确消抖时间、物理边沿带宽或传感器质量。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Immutable input/filter facts and actual counter enable state."
msgstr "不可变输入／过滤器事实与实际计数器启用状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Shared methods; no ring, request, allocation, callback or worker."
msgstr "共享方法；无环形缓冲、请求、分配、回调或工作线程。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:27
msgid "Immutable identity; exact private state owns the whole controller."
msgstr "不可变身份；精确的私有状态拥有整个控制器。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:31
msgid "pwm_group.h"
msgstr "pwm_group.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "Fixed-base atomic multi-channel PWM shadow commits."
msgstr "固定时基、原子的多通道 PWM 影子提交。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "Stage a complete channel group and its internal trigger comparison."
msgstr "暂存完整通道组及其内部触发比较值。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid ""
"Provider declares exact channel count, trigger range and ISR budget. Duties "
"include zero and period. All channels share one fixed base. A failed partial"
" hardware write must disable output and retain fault responsibility rather "
"than release a mixed group to the next update. Stop is explicit; automatic "
"output recovery after break is prohibited."
msgstr ""
"provider 声明精确的通道数、触发范围及 ISR 预算。占空比包含零与 "
"period。所有通道共用一个固定时基。部分硬件写入失败时必须禁用输出并保留故障责任，不能让混合新旧值的通道组进入下一次更新。停止必须显式进行；禁止 "
"break 后自动恢复输出。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "[in] One serialized privileged task/configurable-IRQ owner."
msgstr "[in] 一个串行化特权任务/可配置 IRQ 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "[in] Complete readable batch; no pointer is retained on return."
msgstr "[in] 完整且可读的批次；返回后不保留指针。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid ""
"SUCCESS means one coherent group is staged for a hardware update, not that "
"this update already happened. Invalid input has no effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示一个一致的组已暂存，等待硬件更新，不代表更新已经发生。无效输入没有效果。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "Start only from disabled outputs and an inactive, cleared break."
msgstr "仅输出已禁用且刹车未激活、已清除时启动。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task owner of all cold leases."
msgstr "[in] 拥有全部冷租约的串行化特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "SUCCESS or an error retaining cleanup and any fault responsibility."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS，或返回错误并保留清理及相应故障责任。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "Withdraw master output, channels, counter and owned IRQ sources."
msgstr "撤离主输出、通道、计数器与拥有的 IRQ 源。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid ""
"This source-level promise does not certify the external circuit's electrical"
" safety. Board idle and publisher join belong to assembly."
msgstr "此源码层承诺不认证外部电路的电气安全。Board 空闲电平和发布者汇合属于装配职责。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "[in] Same privileged task owner; cold pin/vector leases persist."
msgstr "[in] 同一个特权任务所有者；冷态引脚/向量租约保持持有。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "SUCCESS proves source withdrawal; failure retains responsibility."
msgstr "SUCCESS 证明来源已撤回；失败保留责任。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "Explicitly clear fault while disabled after checking actual break."
msgstr "禁用期间检查实际刹车状态后显式清除故障。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task recovery owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权任务恢复所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after coherent shadows and break acknowledgment; never enables "
"outputs. Product power-stage recovery policy stays external."
msgstr "仅在影子值一致且 break 已确认后返回 SUCCESS；绝不使能输出。产品功率级恢复策略仍由外部负责。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "Read fixed units and observed enable/fault facts without starting."
msgstr "读取固定单位与观察到的启用／故障事实，不启动硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "[in] Serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 串行化特权任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "[out] Separate writable output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写的输出，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "One synchronous shadow batch; channel order is fixed by assembly."
msgstr "一个同步影子批次；通道顺序由装配固定。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "Fixed units, software fault latch and actual hardware enable state."
msgstr "固定单位、软件故障锁存与实际硬件启用状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "Shared operations; commit must prevent partial shadow publication."
msgstr "共享操作；提交必须防止部分影子发布。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:33
msgid "Immutable identity with no default-device state or allocation."
msgstr "不可变身份；无默认设备状态或分配。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:37
msgid "timer.h"
msgstr "timer.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Fixed timer/channel PWM with one shared base configuration."
msgstr "固定定时器／通道 PWM，共享同一个基准配置。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Atomically stage a reviewed fixed-base PWM duty."
msgstr "原子暂存已审查固定基准 PWM 的占空比。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid ""
"Shadow update becomes effective at next update event; do not infer immediate"
" electrical change from successful staging."
msgstr "影子更新在下一次更新事件生效；成功暂存不代表电气输出立即改变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "[inout] Fixed timer/channel with one serialized writer."
msgstr "[inout] 固定定时器/通道，只有一个串行化写入者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "[in] Positive maintained shared-base period."
msgstr "[in] 已维护共享时基的正数周期。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "[in] Zero through period_ticks, inclusive."
msgstr "[in] 从零到 period_ticks，包含两端。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/STATE/BUSY. Zero/100 percent are explicit constant "
"levels. Shared channels must use one PSC/ARR/base; changing another "
"channel's base is rejected by configuration."
msgstr ""
"成功或 INVALID/STATE/BUSY。零及 100% 对应显式恒定电平。共享通道必须使用同一 "
"PSC/ARR/时基；配置会拒绝改变其他通道的时基。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Enable a previously configured fixed PWM output."
msgstr "启用此前已配置的固定 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "[inout] Execution owner after Board inactive level setup."
msgstr "[inout] Board 已设置无效电平后的执行所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Success or INVALID/STATE."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID/STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Stop PWM at its declared Board inactive electrical level."
msgstr "以声明的 Board 非活动电气电平停止 PWM。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "[inout] Quiesced execution owner; no concurrent set/start."
msgstr "[inout] 已静止的执行所有者；不得并发 set/start。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Success or INVALID; no advanced break/capture promise."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；不承诺高级 break/capture 能力。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Query staged PWM counts and selected timer clock."
msgstr "查询暂存 PWM 计数与选定定时器时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "[in] Fixed initialized channel."
msgstr "[in] 固定且已初始化的通道。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "[out] Staged counts, clock and running state."
msgstr "[out] 已暂存的计数、时钟及运行状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Success or INVALID."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "PWM counts refer to the fixed declared post-prescaler timer clock."
msgstr "PWM 计数对应固定声明的预分频后定时器时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Shared read-only methods using one provider state."
msgstr "使用同一个提供者状态的共享只读方法。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid ""
"Methods follow each public operation's ownership contract. Missing optional "
"methods report UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "各方法遵循对应公共操作的所有权合同。缺失的可选方法返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid "Immutable interface pointing to caller-owned state."
msgstr "指向调用者自有状态的不可变接口。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:39
msgid ""
"Face and state outlive callers, IRQs and retained borrows. Factory lookup "
"neither initializes nor acquires hardware."
msgstr "接口和状态的生命周期覆盖调用方、IRQ 及保留的借用。工厂查找既不初始化，也不取得硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:43
msgid "timer_capture.h"
msgstr "timer_capture.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Optional raw timer edge capture with caller-owned events."
msgstr "可选原始定时器边沿捕获与调用者拥有的事件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Observable loss incidents, not an exact count of physical edges."
msgstr "可观察丢失事件，不是准确的物理边沿总数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Borrow an exact event ring and enable the fixed capture channel."
msgstr "借用准确事件环并启用固定捕获通道。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid ""
"Ring remains borrowed until successful stop. ISR access is confined to this "
"ring. Caller must not modify it or its provider while borrowed. Counter wrap"
" is modulo the reported width; observation time is not an absolute edge "
"timestamp or a clock accuracy qualification."
msgstr ""
"环一直被借用，直到 stop 成功。ISR 对事件存储的访问仅限于该环。借用期间调用方不得修改环或其 "
"provider。计数器按已报告位宽取模回卷；观测时间不是绝对边沿时间戳，也不构成时钟准确度资格证明。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "[in] One privileged task owner, serialized with stop/read."
msgstr "[in] 单一特权任务所有者，与 stop/read 串行执行。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "[inout] Aligned writable ring, capacity positive."
msgstr "[inout] 已对齐的可写环，容量为正数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "[in] Number of events; no hidden buffer or worker."
msgstr "[in] 事件数量；无隐藏缓冲或工作任务。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "SUCCESS transfers the ring borrow; rejection retains nothing."
msgstr "SUCCESS 转移环的借用；拒绝时不保留任何引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Disable and read back channel/IRQ sources before returning storage."
msgstr "归还存储之前禁用并读回通道／IRQ 源。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid ""
"Read drains events after capture stops. Failed detach never frees storage. "
"Board pins, timer clock and shared vector leases are released by cold "
"assembly only after successful stop and publisher quiescence."
msgstr ""
"捕获停止后，read 仍可排空事件。撤离失败绝不释放存储。仅在 stop 成功且发布者静止后，冷装配才释放 Board 引脚、定时器时钟及共享向量租约。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner, with generated IRQ owner retained."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者，并保留生成的 IRQ 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid ""
"SUCCESS is the final access to the ring; BUSY retains the borrow while "
"queued events or failed hardware detachment remain."
msgstr "SUCCESS 是对环的最后一次访问；仍有排队事件或硬件撤离失败时，BUSY 保留借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Copy the oldest event in a short saved-mask metadata section."
msgstr "在短且保存原屏蔽状态的元数据临界区内复制最早事件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "[in] Single privileged task consumer."
msgstr "[in] 单一特权任务消费者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "[out] Separate writable output, unchanged on EMPTY/rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写输出；EMPTY 或拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, STATE or INVALID; no block release is required."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、STATE 或 INVALID；无需另行释放块。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Query counter units and observable queue/loss facts."
msgstr "查询计数器单位与可观察队列／丢失事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid ""
"Hardware overcapture and ring saturation can coalesce edges. A loss incident"
" does not estimate edges, edge frequency or actual IRQ WCET."
msgstr "硬件过捕获和环饱和可能合并边沿。丢失事件不用于估算边沿数量、边沿频率或实际 IRQ WCET。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "[in] Privileged task owner; no concurrent lifecycle writer."
msgstr "[in] 特权任务所有者；不得并发执行生命周期写操作。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "[out] Separate writable snapshot."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写快照。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Hardware modulo counter and the separate IRQ observation time."
msgstr "硬件模计数器与独立的 IRQ 观察时间。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Fixed counter units and current software retention state."
msgstr "固定计数器单位与当前软件保留状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Shared immutable methods; no per-call acquisition or allocation."
msgstr "共享不可变方法；不逐次取得资源或分配。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:45
msgid "Immutable identity; state and methods outlive calls and IRQs."
msgstr "不可变身份；状态和方法必须在所有调用与 IRQ 完全退出前保持有效。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:49
msgid "timer_pulse.h"
msgstr "timer_pulse.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "Finite hardware one-pulse output with explicit final access."
msgstr "具有显式最终访问边界的有限硬件单脉冲输出。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Typedefs"
msgstr "类型定义"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "The same typed face when operations are invoked directly."
msgstr "直接调用 ops 时使用的同一个 typed face。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "Admit one finite pulse without changing the selected waveform shape."
msgstr "接纳一个有限脉冲，不改变所选波形形状。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"The selected owner defines context and timing. Dispatch retains no "
"references, starts no worker and never revokes a live borrow. Provider "
"admission still checks private state and payload aliases. The original "
"argument reaches that owner without a temporary or format conversion."
msgstr ""
"所选 owner 定义上下文与时序。分派本身不保留引用、不启动 worker，也不撤销活跃借用。provider 准入仍检查私有状态与 payload "
"别名。原始参数直接传到该 owner，不建立临时对象或转换格式。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "[in] Stable face under the selected serialized execution contract."
msgstr "[in] 遵循所选串行执行合同的稳定 face。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "[inout] Original stable storage under the operation loan contract."
msgstr "[inout] 遵循操作借用合同的原始稳定存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"Provider result, INVALID for malformed public objects, or UNSUPPORTED when "
"this selected operation is absent."
msgstr "provider 结果；公共对象不合法时为 INVALID，所选操作不存在时为 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "Request pulse withdrawal while retaining the original request loan."
msgstr "请求撤回脉冲，继续保留原始请求借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid ""
"Advance bounded completion or withdrawal; SUCCESS alone is not settlement."
msgstr "有界推进完成或撤回；单独的 SUCCESS 不表示结清。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "Join the finite pulse before reporting that its source has stopped."
msgstr "等待有限脉冲退出后，才报告数据源已停止。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "Copy selected units and current source observations."
msgstr "复制所选单位与当前数据源观测。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"[out] Independent output, changed only as the provider contract permits."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出，仅按 provider 合同允许的方式修改。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "One complete pulse period on the statically ordered channels."
msgstr "按静态顺序排列的通道上的一个完整脉冲周期。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid ""
"Initialize/prepare base before submit. Each width is in the selected post-"
"prescaler ticks, from zero through period_ticks minus one. The remaining "
"leading ticks are inactive; all pulses finish at the same hardware one-pulse"
" boundary. Zero width remains inactive throughout. A full-period active "
"level has no inactive one-pulse end and rejects. ACCEPTED borrows this "
"request and the complete immutable width array through acquire-observed "
"SETTLED. Error/cancel reports zero completed periods. SUCCESS reports one "
"period, not a measured electrical edge."
msgstr ""
"提交前先初始化／准备 base。每个 width 使用所选预分频后的 tick，范围为零到 period_ticks 减一。前面的剩余 ticks "
"为不活动电平；所有脉冲在同一个硬件单脉冲边界结束。零宽度全程不活动。完整周期的活动电平没有不活动的单脉冲尾部，因而拒绝。ACCEPTED 借用该 "
"request 与完整不可变 width 数组，直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。错误／取消报告零个完成周期；SUCCESS "
"报告一个周期，不代表测量过的电气边沿。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "Nominal units and actual source/recovery observations."
msgstr "名义单位及实际源／恢复观察。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "One static owner, driven by a serialized privileged unmasked task."
msgstr "同一个静态 owner，由串行调用的特权、未屏蔽中断 task 推进。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid ""
"Platform prepare leaves counter and outputs off. Factory returns the "
"existing face. submit accepts a READY request before enabling any source; "
"rejection retains no references or new hardware effects. Hardware stops the "
"counter after the one-pulse update. Explicit service still joins outputs and"
" actual IRQ observers before SETTLED. If an internal master is selected, arm"
" the slave before starting that master and supply only one start event until"
" settlement. There is no worker, task or implicit clock owner. A completion "
"first observed at or after the absolute deadline reports TIMEOUT. Failed "
"stop, clock history loss and quarantine never revoke a borrow. Platform "
"close withdraws admission and must complete the same join before System "
"resources can be released. state output must be disjoint from every accepted"
" control and width span; it remains unchanged on rejection."
msgstr ""
"Platform prepare 保持 counter 和输出关闭。factory 返回已有 face。submit 在启用任何源前接受 READY "
"请求；拒绝不保留引用或新硬件效果。硬件在单脉冲 update 后停止 counter。显式 service 仍须 join 输出和真实 IRQ "
"观察者，才发布 SETTLED。若选择内部 master，先 arm slave 再启动 master，并在结算前只提供一次启动事件。没有 "
"worker、task 或隐式时钟 owner。首次在绝对 deadline 当时或之后观察到完成，报告 "
"TIMEOUT。停止失败、时钟历史丢失及隔离都不撤销借用。Platform close 撤回准入，并须完成同一个 join，才可释放 System "
"资源。state 输出须与每份已接受的控制及 width 范围不重叠；拒绝时保持原值。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:51
msgid "Immutable identity with private retained controller storage."
msgstr "不可变身份与私有保留的 controller 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:55
msgid "timer_sequence.h"
msgstr "timer_sequence.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Native finite update-DMA rows and complete source loans."
msgstr "原生有限 update-DMA 行与完整源借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Selected native row layout; every item occupies one DMA transfer."
msgstr "选定的原生行布局；每项占用一次 DMA 传输。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "The same typed face for direct operations."
msgstr "直接调用 ops 时使用的同一个 typed face。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Admit an already encoded native plan without copying its source."
msgstr "接纳已编码原生 plan，不复制源数据。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Request withdrawal without revoking the source or request loan."
msgstr "请求撤回，不撤销源数据或请求借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"Advance bounded tail and withdrawal work; query the request for settlement."
msgstr "有界推进尾部与撤回；查询请求判断是否结清。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Withdraw the source; failed drain preserves every outstanding loan."
msgstr "撤回数据源；排空失败保留全部未归还借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Copy native plan constraints and current owner observations."
msgstr "复制原生 plan 约束与当前 owner 观测。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Encode logical steps into caller-owned native storage before submit."
msgstr "提交前，将逻辑步骤编码到调用者拥有的原生存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"Synchronous task-only preparation with work bounded by the selected step and"
" channel limits. No peripheral MMIO, admission, allocation, conversion at "
"submit, retained reference or owner-state change occurs. All checks precede "
"writes; rejection leaves storage and bytes unchanged. All output extents are"
" disjoint from descriptors, duties, private metadata and each other. Caller "
"proves ordinary memory ownership and stability; the provider rejects known "
"MMIO/private aliases. Success writes only the encoded prefix; unused "
"capacity stays unchanged. Publish using the existing native frame geometry "
"and loan operations. Encoding does not grant DMA reachability or prove "
"waveform timing."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务的同步准备，工作量受所选步骤与通道上限约束。不执行外设 MMIO、准入、分配、提交时转换、引用保留或 owner "
"状态修改。全部检查先于写入；拒绝保持 storage 与 bytes "
"不变。全部输出跨度须与描述符、duties、私有元数据及彼此分离。调用者证明普通内存的所有权与稳定性；provider 拒绝已知 "
"MMIO／私有别名。成功仅写入编码前缀，未用容量不变。使用既有原生帧几何与借用操作发布。编码不授予 DMA 可达性，也不证明波形时序。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "[in] Prepared idle owner under its serialized task contract."
msgstr "[in] 已准备且 idle 的 owner，遵循其串行任务合同。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "[in] Positive immutable descriptor array and complete duties."
msgstr "[in] 正数量的不可变描述符数组及完整 duties。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "[in] Step count within the selected native transfer limit."
msgstr "[in] 所选原生传输上限内的步骤数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "[out] Exclusive ordinary writable memory, not a live loan."
msgstr "[out] 独占的普通可写内存，不是活跃借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "[in] Complete writable extent, including unused tail bytes."
msgstr "[in] 完整可写跨度，包含未使用的尾部字节。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "[out] Separate output receiving the exact encoded byte count."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出，接收精确编码字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed or overlapping storage, UNSUPPORTED for "
"absent encoding or unrepresentable values, OVERFLOW for short storage, BUSY "
"for an active owner, or STATE/CONTEXT."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、存储不合法或重叠时的 INVALID、无编码能力或无法表示取值时的 UNSUPPORTED、存储不足时的 OVERFLOW、owner "
"活跃时的 BUSY，或 STATE／CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Logical period and duties in the selected post-prescaler ticks."
msgstr "以所选分频后 ticks 表示逻辑周期与 duties。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"duty_ticks follows the statically selected logical channel order. A period "
"is positive and each duty is zero through that period. Encoding may reject "
"values the selected native format cannot express. Descriptors and duty "
"arrays are immutable ordinary memory during the synchronous encode call; "
"they are never retained on return."
msgstr ""
"duty_ticks 按静态选定的逻辑通道顺序排列。周期为正，每个 duty 从零到该周期。编码可以拒绝所选原生格式无法表示的值。同步 encode "
"调用期间，描述符与 duty 数组是不可变普通内存；返回后不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "One immutable whole frame loan containing complete native rows."
msgstr "包含完整原生行的不可变整份 frame 借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"Initialize/prepare base first. source must be the exact outstanding frame "
"consumer control. Its single plane has offset zero, contiguous rows, no "
"padding between rows, and the reported items_per_frame times native_bits/8 "
"bytes in each row. ARR_RCR_CCR1_CCR4 contains ARR, RCR/reserved-zero, then "
"CCR1..CCR4 in that order. Unselected compares and RCR/reserved are zero. ARR"
" plus one meets min_period_ticks; each selected compare fits that row's "
"period and the native register bits. ACCEPTED borrows request, control and "
"the whole source through acquire-observed SETTLED. No source conversion or "
"per-row copy occurs. SUCCESS reports source storage bytes staged by DMA; it "
"does not count electrical pulses. Cancellation/error reports zero guaranteed"
" bytes."
msgstr ""
"先初始化／准备 base。source 必须是仍未归还的精确 frame consumer 控制对象。它的单 plane 使用零 offset、连续 "
"rows、无行间 padding；每行字节数为所报告的 items_per_frame 乘以 "
"native_bits/8。ARR_RCR_CCR1_CCR4 依次包含 ARR、RCR／reserved-zero、CCR1..CCR4。未选 "
"compare 及 RCR／reserved 必须为零。ARR 加一满足 min_period_ticks；每个所选 compare 均适合该行 "
"period 和原生寄存器位宽。ACCEPTED 借用 request、control 和完整源，直到 acquire 观察 "
"SETTLED。不转换源，也不逐行复制。SUCCESS 报告 DMA 已 staged 的源存储字节，不统计电脉冲数。取消／错误报告零个保证字节。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Nominal format, declared transfer budget and observed owner state."
msgstr "名义格式、声明的传输预算及观察到的 owner 状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"The budget is an application-declared upper bound, not a physical "
"measurement. native_bits describes DMA item storage, independently of "
"counter width. Tail values may repeat until explicit service joins."
msgstr ""
"预算是应用声明的上界，不是物理测量。native_bits 描述 DMA 项存储，与 counter 位宽独立。尾值可能重复，直到显式 service "
"完成 join。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid "Hardware UPDATE requests advance normal DMA without per-row service."
msgstr "硬件 UPDATE 请求推进 normal DMA，不需要逐行 service。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/timers.md:57
msgid ""
"Platform prepare leaves source and DMA off; factory returns only the "
"existing immutable face. One privileged unmasked task serializes all "
"methods. submit rejects without retained references or new effects; "
"acceptance precedes every source/DMA effect. Explicit service handles "
"terminal status and full withdrawal; no hidden worker exists. Each complete "
"native burst must finish before the next update. The selected declared bus "
"budget must be validated under actual load. Breaking that condition can "
"publish mixed compare values; the API makes no unconditional cross-update "
"atomicity or continuity claim. DMA TC/zero NDTR alone cannot release the "
"loan. The owner withdraws requests and DMA bus activity, observes fresh "
"updates for final shadow application and its tail period, then joins "
"output/IRQ/address access. Tail repetitions and initial idle cycles do not "
"imply missing DMA rows. An absolute deadline includes all final withdrawal. "
"Failed stop retains the complete borrow and resources; old clock/reset "
"history cannot be recreated by restoring register appearances. Platform "
"close must join the same owner before ending the System/time domain. state "
"output cannot overlap any accepted source or control and is unchanged on "
"rejection. Physical waveform and throughput qualification is separate."
msgstr ""
"Platform prepare 保持源与 DMA 关闭；factory 只返回已有不可变 face。同一个特权、未屏蔽中断的 task "
"串行调用所有方法。submit 拒绝不保留引用或新效果；接受先于全部源／DMA 效果。显式 service 处理终态和完整撤回；没有隐藏 "
"worker。每个完整原生 burst 必须在下一次 update 前结束。所选声明总线预算须在实际负载下验证。违反该条件可能发布混合 compare "
"值；API 不承诺无条件的跨 update 原子性或连续性。单凭 DMA TC／NDTR 为零不能归还 loan。owner 撤回请求与 DMA "
"总线活动，观察新的 update 以证明最后 shadow 生效及其尾周期，再 join 输出／IRQ／地址访问。尾部重复与初始 idle 周期不表示 "
"DMA 行丢失。绝对 deadline 包括全部最终撤回。停止失败保留完整借用与资源；恢复寄存器外观不能重建旧时钟／复位历史。Platform "
"close 必须 join 同一 owner 后才可结束 System／时间域。state "
"输出不能与任何已接受的源或控制存储重叠，拒绝时保持原值。物理波形和吞吐资格单独建立。"

